# Dungeon X — Browser Roguelike

## Project
Single-file browser game. Phaser 3 + vanilla JS. No build tools, no npm.
Desktop folder: ~/Desktop/Dungeon X/
Full game bible: docs/dungeon-x-game-bible.md — the CANON. Follow it EXACTLY.
Combat spec: docs/combat-system-dnd.md
Design doc: docs/2026-03-08-dungeon-x-design.md

## Stack
- Phaser 3.80 via CDN (load from: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/phaser@3.80.1/dist/phaser.min.js)
- Single HTML file with embedded JS (split to 2-3 files ONLY if single file exceeds 15,000 lines)
- Pixel art style, 32x32 tile grid, drawn programmatically with drawPixelRect on canvas
- Procedural audio via Web Audio API oscillators — no external sound files
- localStorage for save state, reputation, fragments, best runs
- No frameworks, no React, no bundlers, no npm, no build tools

## Phase Status
- Phase 1 + 1.5: DONE (builds/dungeon-x-phase1.html)
  - Tavern (Rusty Flagon) with Aldric barkeep
