## What NOT to Do
- Don't use Webpack, Vite, or any bundler
- Don't add npm dependencies
- Don't create a server — this is a static HTML file
- Don't use WebGL shaders — keep it simple canvas/Phaser rendering
- Don't change Phase 1 mechanics that already work
- Don't skip the class selection screen
- Don't make combat feel like a slot machine — misses should be common, hits should feel earned
